    gcd(n², n(n + 1))

Factor out n:

    = n × gcd(n, n + 1)

Since consecutive numbers are always coprime:

    gcd(n, n + 1) = 1

Therefore the answer is simply:

    n

--------------------------------------------------

Time: O(1)

Space: O(1)

--------------------------------------------------
